# Shell/command scripts must always keep LF line endings. A CRLF shebang
# line (`#!/bin/sh` followed by \r\n) fails to resolve the interpreter both
# inside Linux containers (breaks the Docker build: "exec .../entrypoint.sh:
# no such file or directory") and on macOS (breaks every native Mac script)
# -- confirmed live after Windows' core.autocrlf=true silently converted
# these to CRLF on checkout. Overrides autocrlf for exactly these files,
# regardless of each contributor's own git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
